  "title": "How to Use Notebooklm Better than 99% of People",
  "description": "How to Use Notebooklm better than 99% of people (Notebooklm Tutorial)\n\nMost users treat NotebookLM like a basic chatbot, but it\u2019s really a research intelligence system for autonomous sourcing, validation, and instant content generation (slides/infographics).\n\nYou can create topic-specific notebooks and use Deep Research for agentic source discovery that finds 50 sources, generates a research report, imports citations, and removes failed/paywalled sources fast.\n\nor even run a 3-step source validation framework: table of publication date/author credentials/source type, identify most-cited sources, and summarize bias/perspective to reduce hallucinations and improve reliability.\n\nGo from ABSOLUTE ZERO to using AI like the people who do this for a living\ud83d\udc47\nhttps://join.parker-prompts.com/?vid=...\n\nWatch Next \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u2022\u00a0How\u00a0to\u00a0Use\u00a0Gemini\u00a03.0\u00a0Pro\u00a0Better\u00a0than\u00a099%\u00a0...\u00a0\u00a0\nWatch Next \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u2022\u00a07\u00a0Hidden\u00a0Gemini\u00a03.0\u00a0Pro\u00a0Features\u00a0No\u00a0One\u00a0Ta...\u00a0\u00a0\n\nI'm Parker. I started this YouTube Channel with the goal to learn more about AI myself and to then pass on the knowledge to anyone willing to listen.\n\nlet's work together: partnerships @ parker-prompts.com",
